    "reviews": "\u201cAchilles: Legends Untold is highly recommended for those looking for an Action-RPG that is out of the ordinary.\u201d<br>3D Juegos<br><br>\u201cAchilles: Legends Untold brings history's strongest warrior to video games in epic fashion. Fans of Soulslikes - or action RPGs in general - shouldn't hesitate to pick it up.\u201d<br>80% \u2013 Gamers Heroes<br><br>\u201cAchilles: Legends Untold honors the legacy of both the character who stars in the game and the good references from which the production is inspired. Beautiful and pleasant to play, it has its own setbacks, but, precise and efficient like the hero, it surprises as one of the best works of the genre.\u201d<br>80% \u2013 PSX Brasil<br>",
