        "ids": [
            2,
            5
        ],
        "notes": "Achilles: Legends Untold is based on Greek mythology, stories of warriors facing their fate in the wars of humans and gods. The game features a violent combat system, there's gushing blood, blood puddles, heads, and limbs that can be severed. Sometimes finishers on boss-type enemies will have the final blow zoomed-in and in slow motion.\r\n\r\nThe enemies are mostly humans but you can also face mythical creatures that resemble animals."
    },
